      <p class="text-turquoise-200 font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-sm mb-3">Partner materials</p>
      <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight max-w-3xl">
        Ensana Hotels — partner fact sheets
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-white/85 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        Detail sheets on all <strong class="text-white">seven Ensana spa hotels</strong> in Mariánské
        Lázně, written for travel agencies: capacity, architecture, in-house mineral springs, spa and
        medical profile, dining, meeting space and direct reservation contacts.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm">
        <a href="/introduce" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/20 transition-colors">
          ← Partner hub
        </a>
        <a href="/introduce/media" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/20 transition-colors">
          Media library
        </a>
        <a href="/en/parking" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/20 transition-colors">
          Parking information
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

